        <h2 class="section-title">
            THE JOURNEY
        </h2>


        <div class="timeline">


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2008</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>IRON MAN</h3>
                    <p>
                        Tony Stark begins his journey and becomes
                        Iron Man.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2011</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>CAPTAIN AMERICA</h3>
                    <p>
                        Steve Rogers becomes Captain America and
                        discovers his new purpose.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2011</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>THOR</h3>
                    <p>
                        Thor begins his journey from Asgard and
                        learns what it means to be worthy.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2012</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>THE AVENGERS</h3>
                    <p>
                        Earth's Mightiest Heroes unite for the
                        first time to protect the world.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2015</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>AGE OF ULTRON</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Avengers face Ultron and fight to
                        protect humanity.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2018</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>INFINITY WAR</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Avengers face their greatest threat
                        when Thanos seeks the Infinity Stones.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-year">2019</div>

                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h3>ENDGAME</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Avengers come together for their final
                        battle against Thanos.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>


